    "title": "EduMind free-course-v1 proposal",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "description": "ADR-0024 Proposed. T001 identities, owner access and read/write envelope only. All endpoints planned, not runtime. T002 must extend lifecycle/actions/visualization schemas and operation events; T003 must extend exercise inputs/feedback safely before implementation. No arbitrary content_json passthrough."
  },
